  <section class="grid min-h-[70svh] place-items-center bg-night-950 px-6 text-center text-white"><div><span class="text-8xl font-black text-lantern-400">404</span><h1 class="serif-tc mt-5 text-4xl font-black">這條巷子不是夜市入口</h1><p class="mt-4 text-white/60">頁面可能已移動，回到首頁查看目前位置與行前資訊。</p><a href="/" class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-full bg-lantern-400 px-6 py-3 font-black text-night-950">回四維夜市首頁</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
